WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.826
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book three.

2
00:00:06.126 --> 00:00:09.489
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.789 --> 00:00:15.960
Unit twenty-four: Thank You and Goodbye. In this unit, you will say thank you and goodbye to teachers and classmates.

4
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:17.649
Thank.

5
00:00:18.349 --> 00:00:20.488
Thank means to tell someone you are grateful.

6
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:22.602
I want to thank my teacher.

7
00:00:23.302 --> 00:00:25.966
Your turn. Say: Thank.

8
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:29.330
Thank.

9
00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:31.144
Teacher.

10
00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:34.714
Teacher means a person who helps students learn.

11
00:00:35.014 --> 00:00:37.106
My teacher is patient and kind.

12
00:00:37.806 --> 00:00:40.586
Your turn. Say: Teacher.

13
00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:44.067
Teacher.

14
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:46.084
Classmates.

15
00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:49.597
Classmates means students in the same class as you.

16
00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:51.885
My classmates are like my family.

17
00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.504
Your turn. Say: Classmates.

18
00:00:58.204 --> 00:00:59.356
Classmates.

19
00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.235
Memories.

20
00:01:01.935 --> 00:01:04.794
Memories means things you remember from the past.

21
00:01:05.094 --> 00:01:07.267
We have many happy memories together.

22
00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.678
Your turn. Say: Memories.

23
00:01:13.378 --> 00:01:14.414
Memories.

24
00:01:15.417 --> 00:01:16.302
Miss.

25
00:01:17.002 --> 00:01:20.696
Miss means to feel sad because someone is not with you.

26
00:01:20.996 --> 00:01:22.404
I will miss my friends.

27
00:01:23.104 --> 00:01:26.360
Your turn. Say: Miss.

28
00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:29.887
Miss.

29
00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:31.757
Card.

30
00:01:32.457 --> 00:01:35.373
Card means folded paper with a picture and a message.

31
00:01:35.673 --> 00:01:37.766
I made a thank-you card for my teacher.

32
00:01:38.466 --> 00:01:40.770
Your turn. Say: Card.

33
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:44.134
Card.

34
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.047
Goodbye.

35
00:01:46.747 --> 00:01:48.653
Goodbye means what you say when you leave.

36
00:01:48.953 --> 00:01:50.488
It's hard to say goodbye.

37
00:01:51.188 --> 00:01:53.713
Your turn. Say: Goodbye.

38
00:01:56.413 --> 00:01:57.263
Goodbye.

39
00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:58.984
Future.

40
00:01:59.684 --> 00:02:01.637
Future means the time that will come.

41
00:02:01.937 --> 00:02:03.194
Good luck in the future!

42
00:02:03.894 --> 00:02:06.511
Your turn. Say: Future.

43
00:02:09.211 --> 00:02:09.957
Future.

44
00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.880
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.155
Sreypich, this is our last class of the book.

46
00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.496
Thank you for teaching us, Mr. Jake.

47
00:02:20.783 --> 00:02:22.913
You're welcome. What will you miss?

48
00:02:24.217 --> 00:02:26.762
I will miss our fun lessons and my classmates.

49
00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.388
I made you a card.

50
00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:33.881
Thank you for the card! I will keep it forever.

51
00:02:35.183 --> 00:02:38.530
Grammar focus: I will miss and Thank you for.

52
00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:42.097
I will miss my classmates. Thank you for teaching us.

53
00:02:42.397 --> 00:02:45.848
After 'Thank you for', use a noun or a verb with -ing.

54
00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.433
Now read and listen. A Thank-You Card.

55
00:02:49.733 --> 00:02:50.920
Dear Mr. Jake,

56
00:02:52.217 --> 00:02:54.599
Thank you for teaching us English this year.

57
00:02:55.883 --> 00:02:58.638
Thank you for being patient and kind to every student.

58
00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.704
I will miss your fun lessons and our happy memories.

59
00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.739
Good luck in the future. Love, Sreypich.

60
00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.644
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:10.944 --> 00:03:12.352
Thank you for blank me.

62
00:03:12.652 --> 00:03:16.549
A, helping. B, help. C, to help.

63
00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:22.875
The answer is A: helping.

64
00:03:24.383 --> 00:03:26.963
Students in the same class as you are your blank.

65
00:03:27.263 --> 00:03:30.789
A, classmates. B, teachers. C, neighbors.

66
00:03:34.783 --> 00:03:37.619
The answer is A: classmates.

67
00:03:39.117 --> 00:03:42.393
To feel sad because someone is not with you is to blank them.

68
00:03:42.693 --> 00:03:45.592
A, miss. B, thank. C, forget.

69
00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:51.908
The answer is A: miss.

70
00:03:53.417 --> 00:03:57.567
Now it's your turn to speak. What will you say to your teacher at the end of the year?

71
00:04:02.867 --> 00:04:07.922
I will say, 'Thank you for teaching me.' I will miss my classmates and our happy memories.

72
00:04:08.222 --> 00:04:10.291
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:16.234
Great work today! You learned eight new words and i will miss and thank you for.

74
00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:20.510
Today's value is gratitude. Say thank you for your home and family.

75
00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.927
See you in Unit twenty-five. Goodbye!

76
00:04:24.227 --> 00:04:26.949
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

